{"event": "sample", "step": 1200, "text": "\n\u201cAnd, how you were a poor woman with me.\u201d\n\nAchin the girl was quite at the other point, by the\nfirst time, with a sudden feeling over the little hand, was so gentle\na heavy voice, which had not the whole expression of an\nwoman\u2019s voice, \u201cand I was so much, I cannot understand what I could\nbe much. I could not have got to her, which she was afraid it would have\nnot come from her, and she had so much. I was at all\ntried that I did not know her, and she would come.\n\n\u201cWhat was she ever?\u201d\n\n\u201cYes, now, then?\u201d\n\n\u201cThat\u2019s what I ever didn\u2019t know her that was her going to her.\u201d\n\nBut she felt that she had been so little a young girl.\n\n\u201cI did not recollect it that she was going to go there, and I\u2019ll\nnot come to her.\u201d\n\n\u201cThey\u2019ve never seen her, and I didn\u2019t tell you what I\u2019ll take care of.\nI can see the one to-night--"}
